{"id":"n66765-1-13","stage":3,"title":"알레르기 · 过敏","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66765-1-13-1","ko":"렌즈가 알레르기를 일으켜서 안과에 갔다 왔어요.","zh":"隐形眼镜引起了过敏，我刚去看了眼科。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"렌즈가","meaning":"隐形眼镜","explanation":"렌즈：隐形眼镜；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"렌즈","audio":"/audio/e302cd1329cfcc550f44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52537","senseId":"2","lemma":"렌즈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알레르기를","meaning":"过敏","explanation":"알레르기：过敏；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"알레르기","audio":"/audio/27c6eb71a8eb67f063fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66765","senseId":"1","lemma":"알레르기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일으켜서","meaning":"发","explanation":"일으키다：发；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"일으키다","audio":"/audio/ab00647038d63720cd1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71697","senseId":"5","lemma":"일으키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안과에","meaning":"眼科","explanation":"안과：眼科；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안과","audio":"/audio/c083b4b5e732cde4eb73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14876","senseId":"1","lemma":"안과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e302cd1329cfcc55","term":"렌즈","zh":"隐形眼镜","audio":"/audio/e302cd1329cfcc550f44.mp3","entryId":"52537","definition":"一种直接贴在眼球角膜上的镜片。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"27c6eb71a8eb67f0","term":"알레르기","zh":"过敏","audio":"/audio/27c6eb71a8eb67f063fe.mp3","entryId":"66765","definition":"某物质触碰身体或进入体内时身体对此产生反应，而出现不舒服或痛的症状。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ab00647038d63720","term":"일으키다","zh":"发","audio":"/audio/ab00647038d63720cd1f.mp3","entryId":"71697","definition":"出现疾病或某种告知身体异常的症状。","pronunciation":["이르키다"]},{"id":"c083b4b5e732cde4","term":"안과","zh":"眼科","audio":"/audio/c083b4b5e732cde4eb73.mp3","entryId":"14876","definition":"治疗眼疾病的医学领域；或指那样的医院。","pronunciation":["안ː꽈"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/63f8a58a157653abbc1d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66765-1-13-2","ko":"앞으로는 안경을 쓰는 게 좋겠구나.","zh":"以后还是戴框架眼镜比较好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞으로는","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안경을","meaning":"眼镜","explanation":"안경：眼镜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31484","senseId":"1","lemma":"안경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠구나.","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"7c40f615a28bcb4a","term":"안경","zh":"眼镜","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3","entryId":"31484","definition":"为了保护眼睛或矫正视力而戴在眼睛上的东西。","pronunciation":["안ː경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"戴","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将某物挂或罩在脸上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7cfc77d225c02591603.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66765","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7143,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["隐形眼镜引起了过敏，我刚去看了眼科。","以后还是戴框架眼镜比较好啊。","今天的作业是什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["隐形眼镜引起了过敏，我刚去看了眼科。","以后还是戴框架眼镜比较好啊。","今天的作业是什么？"],"answer":1}]}
